Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Reluctant heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心脏就是难搞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:27.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:27.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始缝合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盯紧她的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The scariest part about responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于承担责任最令人害怕的部分？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you screw up, and let it slip right through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是当你搞砸了 再也无法掌控一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I heard you did a CABG with Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说你参与了 柏克的冠状动脉绕道手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you get to hold the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你捧心脏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捧了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an amazing feeling. You never forget the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是很神奇的感觉 第一次你永远忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was pretty great just to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在一旁观看也很过瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vicarious thrills, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}间接代入的刺激感
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚点见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think maybe I did something to the heart when I was holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我捧着心脏的时候 好像不小心伤到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I nodded off a little, squeezed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打瞌睡 还捏了一下心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别多想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The heart's a tough muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心肌很强壮的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It can take a squeeze or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捏一两下不碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My fingernail popped a glove, cut straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的指甲戳破手套 直接刺穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, what if I punctured Mrs. Patterson's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 万一我刺破了 派德森太太的心脏怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you had punctured it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你真的刺破心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you would have known when they reperfused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们再灌流的时候就会发现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They got her heart beating. The woman's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然她恢复心跳了 代表她没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So, I shouldn't tell Burke? - Tell him what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那我不该告诉柏克？ - 要说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:54.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:54.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing happened. The woman's OK, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么都没发生 患者没事 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:04:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:04:59.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不要紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you see, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 你看出什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hyperinflated lungs, cloudy with bullae.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两肺过度肿胀 伴有肺大疱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously diminished capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肺部容积严重减少
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She must be having trouble breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她现在肯定呼吸困难
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Course of action?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如何治疗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A bullectomy procedure. Remove the bullae. Reduce the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肺大疱切除术 切除肺大炮 减轻压力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It says here we operated on her back in '99.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}病历显示她1999年 在这里做过背部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Drake has been through this before, but talk her through it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}德雷克太太已经有过经验了 但还是要向她详细说明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And resist the anti-smoking lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要忍住别叫她戒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She feels bad enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她已经很不好受了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, do you think, if they put a picture
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得若把这种照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}of these in a pack of cigarettes, people would stop smoking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印一张在烟盒上 人们就会戒烟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long has your back been hurting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的背部痛多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's chronic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这是慢性病
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Means I have it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是一直都会痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what "chronic" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道“慢性病”的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What kind of pain are you having?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是怎样的痛法？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man, the pain's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 痛得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like a thousand samurai warriors stabbing their swords into my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的脊椎 像是被一千个日本武士拿刀猛刺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm allergic to aspirin, most NSAIDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对阿斯匹林 还有大部分的消炎药过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, maybe we'll start you on morphine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们可能会给你输吗啡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. The only things that will work are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 唯一有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Demerol or dilaudid. A ton of dilaudid. That will set me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是德美罗或氢吗啡酮 10毫克氢吗啡酮就能让我舒服很多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The standard starting dose is two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}标准起始剂量是2毫克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see that Tom Cruise samurai movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看过汤姆克鲁斯 演的《最后的武士》吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pow, pow, pow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exaggerated and overly specific description of his pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过度夸张描述他的疼痛感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A self-prescription.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还自我诊断开药单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Pow, pow, pow"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a dilaudid junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他氢吗啡酮成瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Check the database for history, refer to a program, and discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}查查过往病历数据库 转介他去戒瘾治疗 让他出院
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After you give him something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你得先开药帮他止痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's exactly what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就正中他下怀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Junkie or not, you still have to treat his pain as if it were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论他是否药物成瘾 你都得认真治疗他的疼痛感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:00.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:00.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The first rule in pain management. Always err on the side of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是缓解疼痛的首要原则 宁可谨慎治疗也别轻忽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's in our care. He says he's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我们的患者 而且表示疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Start a central line. His veins are shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以中心静脉滴注用药 他的静脉没地方戳了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The surgery before was supposed to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上次做的手术照理说该有效
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but it never felt right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但就是感觉不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably would have been a good idea to quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戒烟可能是个好办法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我戒了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Four-pack-a-day habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一天抽四包的习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太难受了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go, Mrs. Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 德雷克太太
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点用也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Because it looked...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？因为从X光片上…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, from the damage, we all thought you probably were still smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肺部的损害情况看上去 你似乎还在抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cold turkey, five years ago, and what did I get for my trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我五年前就果断戒了 但我煞费苦心又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still had to quit my job at the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是得辞去餐厅的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But even sitting, it hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就连坐着都会痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}枕头放好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nobody believed me. They all said it was in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没人相信我 他们都说是我在胡思乱想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've seen the films.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过你的X光片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not all in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不全是你在乱想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这你可说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're too damn young to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太年轻了 不适合当医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 喂 - 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm older than I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我比外表成熟多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think this is going to work this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得这次会有用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's your best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为这是你最好的选择了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Straight shooter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你还真直接啊 - 是的 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢直接
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Mr. Patterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派德森先生 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hemodynamics stable?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血液动力稳定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, map has stayed around 80. Cardiac output at 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 平均动脉压80毫米汞柱 心输出量为5
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's good, Dr. Grey? - That's fine, Mr. Patterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 葛蕾医生 这样算好吧？ - 还好 派德森先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heart surgery takes a lot out of the patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心脏手术很消耗患者的体力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but we're monitoring your wife very carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们正密切观察你妻子的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and she should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Sterman, let's see about getting you out of here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史德曼先生 我们来看看你今天是否能出院
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty OK, except I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还不赖 只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I ever want to have a bowel obstruction again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再也不想得肠阻塞了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We get people in here all the time requesting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为有好多患者专门为此而来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you keeping down clear fluids?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能吃下清流质食物吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:10.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And my all-time favorite question to ask a patient. Have you pooped yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:10.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接着是我最爱问患者的问题 你排便了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not exactly sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you'd probably know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Passed gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}排气了吗？
