Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？如果我拿出便携测谎仪来…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I shouldn't try and lie. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该试图骗你的 我知道
