Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I do research now, and I have a life, a family.
