Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果成功了 你会邀我去派对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, great. OK, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 好极了 好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Take it easy. - Mr. Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 放轻松 - 佛洛斯特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where have you been? - We're going to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们去哪了？ - 我们会好好照顾你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Just hang on. - Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 稍等一下 - 你们到底跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I tell you to start a central line, you start a central line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你做中心静脉滴注 你就该照办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No judgment, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不容置喙 不准质疑
