Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过去四个月 这家伙进了七家医院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a major addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他严重成瘾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The patient has a three-lumbar fusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}患者做了低位腰椎融合手术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a junkie. We shouldn't be giving him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他药物成瘾 我们不该给他…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he's an addict, but his pain is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 他是有药瘾 但他也真的很痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lose the attitude, get down there, start a central line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别耍性子 快下去做中心静脉滴注
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Told me I had a towel inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说我体内有条毛巾
