Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:31.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A surgeon. An older man. Handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:31.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个外科医生 他是一个老帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's Dr. Webber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是伟柏医生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's our chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我们的主任
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:43.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a towel that somebody left the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:43.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那条毛巾是上次手术留下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会做那种事？
