Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么做不太对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, ma'am. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确实不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样是不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was walking around with a towel inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我之前体内一直有条毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could that happen?
