Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（患者：史黛芬妮德雷克）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（副刀：普瑞斯顿柏克医生）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So? What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now you keep this to yourself while we work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你先保密 我们会想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:15:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:15:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}务必为我这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Yeah. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure? Because you seem not OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定？因为你看上去很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine. CABG was long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事 冠脉绕道术太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me take you out to dinner tonight. You can tell me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我请你吃饭吧 你可以和我聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Real food, waiters, big chunks of carbs in a basket.
