Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不行
