Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道派对的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your friends will be at the party. You and I can be alone somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你的朋友们去那个派对 我们单独去别的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know about the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道有派对的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for not inviting me, by the way. That felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 谢谢你没邀请我 被忽略的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dinner. Think about dinner. Perfect opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.75,0:16:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃晚餐吧 想想晚餐的事 绝佳机会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:48.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:48.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Started having swelling over her sternum, then blood started gushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的胸骨四周突然肿胀 血也不断涌出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke is on his way right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生正在赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is she dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody get him out of here. Keep applying pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦带家属出去 继续加压
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:56.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tyler, call for an OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰勒 准备手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell happened? She got her protamine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底怎么搞的？注射精蛋白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Per protocol. No allergic, anaphylactic, or histamine responses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}依照程序给的 没有过敏反应 过敏性休克或组织胺反应
