Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
