Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:34.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You ask her cardiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:34.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去问问她的心脏科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She had lost 100 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她减了45公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you dare try to hang this on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你别把责任推给她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mr. Patterson, please. - We're through talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 派德森先生 拜托 - 言尽于此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:06.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't like me very much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:06.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不太喜欢我 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jerry, it's not you specifically. It's just people like you. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰瑞 我不是针对你 而是像你一样的那些人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doc, I'm feeling pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生 我觉得好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pain's about a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大概三分轻微疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A three? That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三分？太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Frost, I'm glad we could help you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佛洛斯特先生 很高兴能帮到你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:24.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}as well as County, Mercy West, Seattle Pres.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:24.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一如郡医院、西慈善和长老医院
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:26.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A lot of people have helped you out lately, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:26.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近很多人都帮你止痛了 杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're pleased we could do our part.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴我们也尽了一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's on discharge today, Dr. Karev?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生 今天谁负责出院事宜？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹史蒂文斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Frost, Dr. Stevens is gonna discharge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佛洛斯特先生 史蒂文斯医生会为你办出院手续
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't discharge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能让我出院
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm in pain. - You were in pain. Now you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我还会痛 - 你之前很痛 现在不会了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:41.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Karev here is going to recommend some wonderful treatment programs for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:41.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生会给你推荐一些 很有效的治疗课程
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找人帮帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't just do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能这么做！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just did, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}木已成舟 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:51.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, any luck yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:51.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 成功了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looks like you're gonna have to spend another night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你又得在这里待一晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate to miss the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌参加不了派对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:00.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:00.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去得了派对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are the last person on my list, so it's looking pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我今天负责的最后一位患者 所以应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, doctors have lives after all. Who'd have thunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到医生居然真可以有私生活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:10.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Stevens, discharge my guy in 342.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:10.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史蒂文斯医生 麻烦办理342号房患者出院
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别用那种表情看我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not gonna take very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}办理出院又不会很久
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's not. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很快的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You paged me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呼叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna be a while. Do you think you could get home to sign for the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:28.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有事耽搁了 你能不能回家帮忙签收啤酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you have your boyfriend sign for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么不叫你男友帮你签收？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:35.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a very annoying way of sneaking up on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:35.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你偷听别人说话真的很烦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:37.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe if you were a little less creepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:37.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不是因为你这么诡异…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't come anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我也不会去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:39.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate big parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:39.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌大型派对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.83,0:23:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is Meredith the only person who doesn't know the size of this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.83,0:23:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝是全医院里 唯一不知道派对规模的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't. She's gone already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说不了了 她已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么 这么快？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:50.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she had... Excuse me. An errand to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:50.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她好像有…让一让 有事情要办
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't think Meredith's going to mind about the party, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝应该不会介意派对的事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to make it very clear to her that I had nothing to do with this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定要和她说清楚 我和派对这件事一点关系也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:23:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:23:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I'm late. It was the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了 刚才塞车了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't matter, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. Don't tell me the notary didn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 公证人该不会还没来吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.33,0:24:19.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody's here. It's just your mother isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.33,0:24:19.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都来了 只是你母亲神智不清
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you people want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.29,0:24:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这些人想要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need you to sign the lawyer's papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要你签一些法律文件
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a cranial reconstruction in a half an hour. I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}半小时后我要做颅骨重建手术 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, mom. We're all here. We have a notary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 妈妈 大家都来了 公证人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need you to focus,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.54,0:24:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I need you to sign these papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.54,0:24:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把这些文件签好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.88,0:24:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an emergency surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.88,0:24:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是紧急手术
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没时间跟你们耗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:47.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can't sign anything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:47.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她现在什么都无法签
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.33,0:24:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's sundowning. We should have done this earlier in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.33,0:24:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她现在状态不佳 我们应该早点处理完的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I couldn't come earlier in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法早点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a job and a life, and I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有工作和生活要顾 现在我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.04,0:24:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna have to come back tomorrow, when she's lucid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.04,0:24:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在只能等她明天 神智清醒时再来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:00.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, why did she put this off for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:00.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她为什么拖了这么久 不肯处理这件事？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And why did you let her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 你为什么放任她？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't it strike you as slightly irresponsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不觉得这样很不负责任吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what the hell is wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这些人到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could touch that, but I'd have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:42.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你碰了我就会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.62,0:26:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, about that towel thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.62,0:26:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那条毛巾的事怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.04,0:26:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's been taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.04,0:26:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经处理好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.08,0:26:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.08,0:26:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.71,0:26:55.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't need to concern yourself with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.71,0:26:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件事不用你操心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.54,0:26:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's gonna happen?
