Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.42,0:31:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是认真的 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're interns, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是实习医生 汉克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The hospital owns us. It's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要替医院卖命 这是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.38,0:31:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.38,0:31:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸会了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you guys see him through recovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们能照顾他到恢复意识吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.96,0:31:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, I'll take it. - No, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.96,0:31:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 交给我 - 不 我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's OK, Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 史蒂文斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.50,0:31:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's my patient now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.50,0:31:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他也是我的患者
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I got it. See your hockey player. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用 我来 去见你的冰球选手吧 我是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:42.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:42.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.17,0:31:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess. Thanks, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.17,0:31:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那谢了 亚力克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:01.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.67,0:32:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.67,0:32:02.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.58,0:32:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:10.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I didn't have a chance to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:10.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我没时间打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.92,0:32:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My patient needed brain surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.92,0:32:13.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的患者需要做脑部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like, we were inside his brain. How cool is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们真的进到他脑子里了 很酷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.71,0:32:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.71,0:32:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.00,0:32:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a party at your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.00,0:32:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你家在办派对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, did you get a chance to hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你去玩过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.75,0:32:27.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted you to meet some of the people I work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.75,0:32:27.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想让你认识一下我的同事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.38,0:32:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care about the people you work with. I just want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.38,0:32:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎你的同事 我只想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't mind meeting the people I worked with when they were models.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前你可不介意认识我的模特同事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.21,0:32:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, when they were models,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.21,0:32:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你以前当模特的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.67,0:32:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you actually showed up to your own parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.67,0:32:40.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是会参加自己举办的派对的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.17,0:32:43.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.17,0:32:43.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.46,0:32:49.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my life now, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.46,0:32:49.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汉克 这就是我现在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.08,0:32:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I work 100-hour weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.08,0:32:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一周工作一百小时
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.04,0:32:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't always show up to my own parties on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.04,0:32:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经常不能准时出席自己的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.33,0:32:56.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My patients have to come first. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.33,0:32:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}患者是我的第一顺位…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.67,0:33:01.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just flew across the entire country, and there's a 100 people at your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.67,0:33:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我飞越整个国家来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.08,0:33:01.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果你家有一堆人在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A hundred people who understand what I do all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那一堆人能理解我每天的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I shouldn't have to apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该需要为此道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:07.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:07.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}的确不用
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, let's just go by the party for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我们就去派对玩一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll really like everyone once you get a chance to know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.00,0:33:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一旦了解他们 你就会喜欢大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.71,0:33:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.71,0:33:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.29,0:33:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hank, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.29,0:33:26.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汉克 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.21,0:34:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, in some states, you get arrested for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.21,0:34:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在有些州 你这样是会被捕的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you blew me off for a bottle of tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就为了一瓶龙舌兰拒绝我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tequila's no good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}龙舌兰对你无益
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.96,0:34:48.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't call, doesn't write.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.96,0:34:48.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会说话 也不会写字
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:50.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not nearly as much fun to wake up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:50.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}清醒之后就更无趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.12,0:35:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take me for a ride, Derek.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.12,0:35:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}德瑞克 带我去兜风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it sounds like the party's winding down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听上去派对好像快结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.17,0:35:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Listen to me! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.17,0:35:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 听我说！ - 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should probably sneak inside now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该偷偷溜回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.58,0:35:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've done enough sneaking for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.58,0:35:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚已经够偷偷摸摸了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.62,0:35:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was good sneaking, but enough sneaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.62,0:35:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然很好 但我不要再偷偷来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.54,0:35:26.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'd say we're pretty good sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.54,0:35:26.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我们还真擅长偷来暗去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.12,0:35:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mind moving this tail wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.12,0:35:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦移一下车
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.04,0:35:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're blocking me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.04,0:35:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的车出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.83,0:35:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.83,0:35:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来还不够擅长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.88,0:36:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When's your meeting with the chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.88,0:36:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你什么时候要见主任？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.50,0:36:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.50,0:36:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.71,0:36:21.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy mother of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.71,0:36:21.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 这也太乱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.17,0:36:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You missed doctor-palooza.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.17,0:36:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你错过医生狂欢派对了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.42,0:36:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.42,0:36:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然你没错过
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.71,0:36:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should probably never speak to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.71,0:36:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该再也不要和你说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so sorry, Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很抱歉 梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.04,0:36:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had no idea it was going to get so...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.04,0:36:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我完全没想到会变成…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.71,0:36:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.71,0:36:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.42,0:36:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.42,0:36:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.67,0:36:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What would I be doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.67,0:36:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我还能干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.29,0:36:43.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Preparing for your career-altering meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.29,0:36:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为可能改变你职业生涯的会议做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.04,0:36:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.04,0:36:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That heart wall shouldn't have torn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心室壁不该破的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.71,0:36:49.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything in the patient's history?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.71,0:36:49.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}查过患者的病历吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.25,0:36:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Husband said she was in the best shape of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.25,0:36:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她丈夫说她手术前身体状况非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.58,0:36:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She lost 100 pounds last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.58,0:36:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去年她瘦了45公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hundred pounds in a year. How's her muscle mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一年瘦了45公斤啊 她的肌肉量如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you even know whose that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道这之前是谁在喝的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.00,0:37:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm hoping it was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.00,0:37:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望是你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.00,0:37:13.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.00,0:37:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.33,0:37:18.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}50 says Meredith gets tossed out on her ass, and Burke walks away clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.33,0:37:18.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赌50美元 梅若迪丝被开除 柏克平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.71,0:37:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please be nice to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.71,0:37:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托对她好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, I have done a lot of research on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了很多相关研究
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and Dr. Burke has been kind enough to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生也提供了很多帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.83,0:37:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I understand my responsibility in what I've done wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.83,0:37:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也明白自己哪里做错了 该负起什么责任
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}However, I do think the patient's history is significant in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而 我认为患者的病史 在此次病例中至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.83,0:37:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She still weighs 200 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.83,0:37:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她目前体重仍有91公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.79,0:37:39.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which is why no one even noticed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.79,0:37:39.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以才会被大家忽略了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, with that kind of a weight drop, it doesn't matter how much you weigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但以那种速度减肥 关键就不在于体重多寡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.33,0:37:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Technically, you're anorexic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.33,0:37:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实际上而言 这是厌食症
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Along with all that fat, she was losing heart muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:47.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她减掉脂肪的同时 心肌也变少了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.88,0:37:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That certainly could be the reason for a small poke to become a large tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.88,0:37:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这确实有可能 是小破口变成大裂口的主因
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.17,0:37:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That still doesn't change the fact, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.17,0:37:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这依然没有改变事实
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.21,0:37:56.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The poke wasn't reported by Dr. Grey at the time of the occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.21,0:37:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾医生并没有及时呈报出现小破口
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.21,0:37:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And if I could change that... - And you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.21,0:37:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 如果时光倒流… - 这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've left yourself and the hospital open to a tremendous amount of liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你导致自己和医院 都得承担巨大的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.21,0:38:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not if the weight loss caused the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.21,0:38:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这是患者体重骤减造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.79,0:38:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I've no choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.79,0:38:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've spoken to the husband, and I believe as long as his wife remains stable...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经和患者丈夫谈过了 我认为只要他妻子病情稳定…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't take your beliefs to the bank, Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的保证又不值钱 柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.88,0:38:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Dr. Grey made a huge error here. - And she reported it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.88,0:38:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 葛蕾医生犯下了大错 - 她也呈报了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.29,0:38:19.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And in front of the patient's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.29,0:38:19.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且还当着患者丈夫的面
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she reported it. She spoke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她呈报了 她说出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.17,0:38:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five years ago, as a CT fellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.17,0:38:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五年前 我在心外科当研究医师时
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:29.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a nagging feeling that I didn't check the body cavity
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:29.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总觉得不太对劲 似乎没有仔细检查
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}of a lung patient closely enough before I closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}患者的肺腔就进行缝合了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.92,0:38:35.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The patient seemed fine post-op, and I was in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.92,0:38:35.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}患者术后似乎没什么问题 我当时也在赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yesterday, you and Dr. Bailey
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而昨天你和贝利医生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}pulled a towel out from under that patient's lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从那位患者肺部取出了一条毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.67,0:38:45.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't I report it at an appropriate time?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.67,0:38:45.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当时为何没有适时呈报？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe because I was afraid that I would be called
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许是因为我害怕得参加这种会议
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:50.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}into a meeting where some hospital lawyer's fear
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:50.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医院的律师因为怕承担责任
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}of liability could end my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导致我的医生生涯结束
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even great doctors make mistakes, and when we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再伟大的医生都会犯错 而当我们犯错了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.62,0:39:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we've got to have a chance to speak up without fear of retribution
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.62,0:39:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该要能够 毫无顾忌地直接说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or everyone suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以免大家都受害
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Grey spoke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾医生说出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.79,0:39:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Responsibility, it really does suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.79,0:39:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}责任真的很讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.29,0:39:27.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith. You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.29,0:39:27.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.62,0:39:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, one-month probation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.62,0:39:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 有一个月的观察期
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.33,0:39:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Good. That's good. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.33,0:39:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那就好 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.12,0:39:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Burke saved my ass in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.12,0:39:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克真是救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.08,0:39:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you all have something better to do? Come on, people. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.08,0:39:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们难道没事干了吗？ 快去 快一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was always gonna tell them about the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他本就想呈报毛巾的事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.50,0:39:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just wanted to wait for the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.50,0:39:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是在等适当的时机
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Information is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}信息就是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.38,0:40:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unfortunately, once you get past the age of braces and training bras,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.38,0:40:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很可惜 一旦过了戴牙套 穿少女胸罩的年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}responsibility doesn't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}责任就会伴随你一生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jerry, this is Sloane. She's here to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰瑞 这位是史洛安 如果你愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to you, if you want, about options for rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她来和你谈谈戒瘾的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.42,0:40:36.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It can't be avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.42,0:40:36.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们无法逃避责任
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.12,0:40:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Drake,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.12,0:40:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}德雷克太太
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot begin to tell you how truly sorry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的对你感到非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.88,0:40:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Either someone makes us face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.88,0:40:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要么有人会逼我们面对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.75,0:40:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or we suffer the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.75,0:40:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然就是我们得承担后果
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie! I did it! I pooped!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹！成功了！我大便了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.46,0:41:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.46,0:41:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.96,0:41:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Missed your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.96,0:41:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}错过派对了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:14.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Life as a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:14.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是外科医生的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.83,0:41:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And loving every minute of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.83,0:41:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每分每秒我都爱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And still, adulthood has its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过 成为大人也有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.75,0:41:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.75,0:41:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, the shoes, the sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是指各种鞋子、性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.17,0:42:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the no parents anywhere telling you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.17,0:42:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有父母一直在你耳边唠叨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.96,0:42:17.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.96,0:42:17.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那其实超棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.08,0:42:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}字幕翻译：许晨翎
